regress\artifacts\lcaconfbus1kill\pass1_panel\ollama_minimax.txt:7:**Q2 — bus source.** REASONED, partly UNCHECKABLE. Comment: bus in tag bits 23..16. Code: `ioc_conf & 1`. Two sources. Coherence: premise 1's `idata & ~1 is 0` (under the only interpretation consistent with the defect — see premise audit) means the write stores only bit 0, so `ioc_conf` ∈ {0, 1} always. The tag's bus byte, in any reachable state, also matches (0 or 1). Coherent for what the model can express. The model is silent for bus ≥ 2 — there are no bits in `ioc_conf` for them. **What would settle "which source does real LCA use":** a citation to the LCA spec or to NetBSD's `lca_pci.c` for the register field that carries the bus number on type-1. NOT in the packet. The proposed fix using `bus = ioc_conf & 1` is correct for this model's reachability and does not need to change.
regress\artifacts\lcaconfbus1kill\pass1_panel\ollama_minimax.txt:13:**Q5 — not closed.** READ from brief. `default:` arm of `lca_ioc` and `lca_interrupt_{assert,deassert}` are separate kills, untouched by this fix.
regress\artifacts\lcaconfbus1kill\pass1_panel\ollama_minimax.txt:19:- **Premise 1 wording.** READ. "idata & ~1 is 0" is ambiguous: (a) "the bits masked off are 0" (idata has only bit 0 set; write is clean) or (b) "the value stored is 0" (idata=1, mask=~1, result=0). Only interpretation (a) produces the defect. The parenthetical does not by itself prove (a). **UNCHECKABLE from packet.** What settles it: the actual `lca_ioc_write` handler for `LCA_IOC_CONF`. The defect story only needs (a); the wording alone doesn't establish it.
regress\artifacts\lcaconfbus1kill\pass1_panel\ollama_minimax.txt:27:**Source-denominator caveat.** I cannot read files, so I cannot enumerate callers of `bus_pci_setaddr`. The fix only INVOKES `bus_pci_setaddr(bus, dev, func, reg)` from `DEVICE_ACCESS(lca_pci_conf)` with arguments derived from `tag` / `ioc_conf & 1`. Argument order matches the existing call site in the verbatim extract. No other call site is altered by the patch.
regress\artifacts\lcaconfbus1kill\pass1_panel\ollama_minimax.txt:30:- Premise 1's ambiguous parenthetical (above) — would be settled by reading `lca_ioc_write`.
